                <invention-title lang="de">FEUCHTIGKEITSABLEITENDES UND SCHWEISSABLEITENDES TEXTIL</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">TEXTILE ABSORBANT L'HUMIDITÉ ET MASQUANT LA TRANSPIRATION</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">MOISTURE WICKING AND PERSPIRATION CONCEALING TEXTILE</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>An upper-body garment comprising a knit spacer textile that comprises a first knit layer formed from a first plurality of yarns that has been treated with a durable water repellant (DWR) finish prior to being formed in the first knit layer. The knit spacer textile further comprising a second knit layer formed from a second plurality of yarns that has been treated with a wicking finish prior to being formed into the second knit layer, and a plurality of tie yarns that interconnect the first knit layer and the second knit layer, wherein the first plurality of yarns and the second plurality of yarns comprise from about 80% by weight to about 90% by weight of the knit spacer textile.</p>
            </abstract>
